<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Knights sells sand dump to ERPM.</title>
<headline>Knights sells sand dump to ERPM.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Knights Gold Mining Co Ltd on Tuesday announced it had disposed of its Cason sand dump to East Rand Proprietary Mines Ltd (ERPM).</p>
<p>Knights said that this was in line with its proposal to do so at its general meeting last Monday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
